  <section class="container" style="padding: 40px 28px 0; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);">
    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8;">
      MediHelp provides free medical billing tools to help patients audit hospital bills, verify CPT codes, understand CARC and RARC claim denial codes, compare prescription drug prices, and find credentialed healthcare providers. Whether you received an unexpected medical bill, want to understand your Explanation of Benefits (EOB), check for duplicate charges, or get professional human negotiation support — MediHelp helps you take control of your healthcare expenses.
    </p>
  </section>

