            {
              q: "What are the main coronary arteries and their territories?",
              a: "<b>Left Coronary Artery (LCA):</b> Divides into <b>LAD</b> (Anterior LV/Septum) and <b>LCx</b> (Lateral LV).<br><b>Right Coronary Artery (RCA):</b> Supplies the RA, RV, SA node, and AV node (in 80% of people)."
            },
            {
