            { q: "Embryologic structure that forms the Smooth parts of the Left and Right Ventricles?", a: "Bulbus Cordis." },
            { q: "Embryologic origin of the Ascending Aorta and Pulmonary Trunk?", a: "Truncus Arteriosus (divided by the Aorticopulmonary septum)." },
            { q: "Which cells are responsible for the formation of the Aorticopulmonary Septum?", a: "Neural Crest Cells." },
            { q: "The Foramen Primum and Foramen Secundum are involved in the development of...?", a: "The Atrial Septum." },
            { q: "Clinical result of failure of the Septum Secundum and Septum Primum to fuse?", a: "Patent Foramen Ovale (PFO)." },
            { q: "The 3rd Pharyngeal Arch Artery gives rise to?", a: "Common Carotid Artery and proximal Internal Carotid Artery." },
