            {
              "q": "Difference between Benign and Malignant tumors regarding borders?",
              "a": "<b>Benign:</b> Circumscribed/Encapsulated; Malignant: Poorly defined/Invasive."
            },
            {
              "q": "Definition of <b>Choristoma</b>?",
