                                      "q": "Best drug for prophylaxis of migraines?",
                                      "a": "Propranolol, Topiramate, or Amitriptyline."
                            },
                            {
                                      "q": "Best drug for acute management of status epilepticus?",
                                      "a": "IV <b>Benzodiazepines</b> (Lorazepam or Diazepam).\n\nFinal Check: Systemic \"Oddities\""
                            },
                            {
                                      "q": "Mechanism of action of Pentazocine?",
                                      "a": "Opioid Kappa-receptor agonist and Mu-receptor partial agonist/antagonist."
                            },
                            {
                                      "q": "Risk of giving Pentazocine to a patient already on Morphine?",
                                      "a": "May precipitate withdrawal due to Mu-receptor antagonism."
