                                      "a": "In utero exposure to Diethylstilbestrol (<b>DES</b>)."
                            },
                            {
                                      "q": "Characteristic histologic finding in Sarcoma Botryoides (Rhabdomyosarcoma)?",
                                      "a": "Spindle-shaped cells with \"cambium layer\" and skeletal muscle differentiation (desmin+)."
                            },
                            {
                                      "q": "Defining feature of the <b>Transformation Zone</b> in the cervix?",
                                      "a": "Area where squamous epithelium meets columnar epithelium; site of most <b>HPV</b> infections.\n\nUterus and Endometrium"
                            },
                            {
                                      "q": "Primary driver of <b>Endometrial Hyperplasia</b>?",
                                      "a": "Unopposed estrogen (obesity, <b>PCOS</b>, or exogenous source)."
