                                      "q": "Definition of a <b>Meigs Syndrome</b>?",
                                      "a": "Triad of ovarian fibroma, ascites, and pleural effusion."
                            },
                            {
                                      "q": "Definition of a <b>Krukenberg Tumor</b>?",
                                      "a": "Metastatic signet-ring cell carcinoma to the ovaries, usually from a gastric primary.\n\nGestational and Placental Pathology"
                            },
                            {
                                      "q": "Genetic makeup of a Complete <b>Hydatidiform Mole</b>?",
                                      "a": "46,XX or 46,XY (all paternal DNA; empty egg fertilized by two sperm or one sperm that duplicates)."
