                                      "q": "Primary symptom of <b>Placenta Abruptio</b>?",
                                      "a": "Painful vaginal bleeding in the third trimester.\n\nMale Reproductive: Testis and Prostate"
                            },
                            {
                                      "q": "Most common risk factor for Testicular Germ Cell Tumors?",
                                      "a": "<b>Cryptorchidism</b> (undescended testes)."
