                            {
                                      "q": "Classic clinical pentad of <b>PCOS</b>?",
                                      "a": "Obesity, hirsutism, acne, infertility, and oligomenorrhea."
                            },
                            {
                                      "q": "Association of <b>Lichen Sclerosus</b> with other diseases?",
