            { q: "Physical exam sign for Gastric Cancer metastasis to the periumbilical area?", a: "Sister Mary Joseph nodule." },
            { q: "Presentation of Menetrier's Disease?", a: "Hyperplastic gastropathy, protein loss, and \"brain-like\" rugae." },
