            { q: "Why avoid Colonoscopy during acute Diverticulitis?", a: "High risk of perforation." },
            { q: "Characteristic of Meckel’s Diverticulum?", a: "Rule of 2s (2 inches long, 2 feet from ileocecal valve, 2% of population)." },
            { q: "Diagnostic test for Meckel’s Diverticulum?", a: "Technetium-99m pertechnetate scan (\"Meckel scan\")." },
