            { q: "Presence of Anti-HBs alone (without Anti-HBc) indicates?", a: "Immunity via Hepatitis B vaccination." },
            { q: "Requirement for Hepatitis D (Delta agent) infection?", a: "Co-infection or superinfection with Hepatitis B (requires HBsAg)." },
