            {
                        "q": "Under what condition is a sentinel lymph node biopsy performed during a mastectomy for DCIS?",
                        "a": "When a massive area of DCIS requires a total mastectomy, because if invasive cancer is found on final pathology, a sentinel loop can no longer be mapped later."
