                        "q": "A patient presents with an adenocarcinoma located in the splenic flexure. What standard surgical resection is indicated?",
                        "a": "Left hemicolectomy, including the ligation of the left colic artery and branches of the inferior mesenteric artery."
            },
            {
                        "q": "What anatomical structure determines the boundary between a colon cancer and a rectal cancer?",
                        "a": "The peritoneal reflection, typically located roughly 12 to 15 centimeters from the anal verge."
