                        "q": "What is the standard management for a patient presenting with an acute, completely obstructing descending colon cancer without perforation?",
                        "a": "Urgent surgical resection (e.g., left colectomy or subtotal colectomy) or endoscopic deployment of a self-expanding metallic stent as a bridge to surgery."
