            {
                        "q": "What defines a resectable vs. unresectable pancreatic adenocarcinoma on preoperative CT imaging?",
                        "a": "Encasement or occlusion of major vascular structures, specifically the superior mesenteric artery (SMA), celiac axis, or portal vein/SMV confluence."
