            {
                        "q": "Long-term clinical sequela of a DVT characterized by chronic lower extremity edema, hyperpigmentation, stasis dermatitis, and venous ulcers due to valvular destruction?",
                        "a": "Post-Thrombotic Syndrome (PTS)."
