            {
                        "q": "Optimal surgical management for a patient presenting with an infected, mycotic abdominal aortic aneurysm?",
                        "a": "Wide local debridement of the infected aorta, extra-anatomical vascular reconstruction bypass (e.g., axillobifemoral bypass) through clean tissue planes, and long-term targeted intravenous antibiotics."
