            {
                        "q": "Definition of an endovascular \"Snorkel\" or \"Chimney\" technique used during complex EVAR?",
                        "a": "Placement of parallel covered stents into visceral branches (renal or mesenteric arteries) running alongside the main aortic endograft body to preserve branch perfusion while treating juxtarenal or suprarenal aneurysms."
